<p class="kt-adv-heading35_649369-73 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading35_649369-73">Depending on the complexity of the design and the service chosen, appointments usually range from 60 to 90 minutes. We believe in precision over speed to ensure your nails are both beautiful and healthy.</p>
</div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-2 kt-pane35_fe93d9-0a"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title">How long will my manicure last?</span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="kt-adv-heading35_05cc8f-a0 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading35_05cc8f-a0">Our manicures are designed for durability, typically lasting 3 to 4 weeks depending on your natural nail growth and lifestyle.</p>
</div></div></div>



<div class="wp-block-kadence-pane kt-accordion-pane kt-accordion-pane-3 kt-pane35_667021-4d"><div class="kt-accordion-header-wrap"><button class="kt-blocks-accordion-header kt-acccordion-button-label-show" type="button"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title-wrap"><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-title">How can I make my nails last longer?</span></span><span class="kt-blocks-accordion-icon-trigger"></span></button></div><div class="kt-accordion-panel kt-accordion-panel-hidden"><div class="kt-accordion-panel-inner">
<p class="kt-adv-heading35_13aa89-68 wp-block-kadence-advancedheading" data-kb-block="kb-adv-heading35_13aa89-68">We recommend wearing gloves when using harsh cleaning chemicals and applying cuticle oil daily to keep the nail bed hydrated. Avoid using your nails as &#8220;tools&#8221; to open cans or boxes!</p>
</div></div></div>



